    "Engine": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Engine"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Enter the address, key and model name in your coding agent.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Trag Adresse, Schlüssel und Modellnamen in deinem Coding-Agenten ein."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Enter the server's address, e.g. podlight.example.com.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Gib die Adresse des Servers ein, z. B. podlight.example.com."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Environment variables": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Umgebungsvariablen"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Every start has an end. Idle pods stop by themselves.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Jeder Start hat ein Ende. Ungenutzte Pods stoppen von selbst."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Extend": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Verlängern"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Extend by One Hour": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Um eine Stunde verlängern"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Extend it if you are still working.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Verlängere, wenn du noch arbeitest."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Fast": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Schnell"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Finding a GPU": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Suche eine Karte"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "For": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Für"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "For %@ tokens the model needs about %lld GB of card memory.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Für %@ Token braucht das Modell etwa %lld GB Kartenspeicher."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "For %1$@ tokens the model needs about %2$lld GB of card memory."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "For tools that read OpenAI's environment variables, such as Aider: add these lines to ~/.zshrc or run them before the tool.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Für Programme, die die OpenAI-Umgebungsvariablen lesen, etwa Aider: Trage diese Zeilen in ~/.zshrc ein oder führe sie vor dem Programm aus."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "For ~/.config/opencode/opencode.json": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Für ~/.config/opencode/opencode.json"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "For ~/.pi/agent/models.json": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Für ~/.pi/agent/models.json"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Format": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Format"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Format %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Format %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "From other Macs": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Von anderen Macs"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "GPU": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Karte"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "GPU %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "GPU %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "GPU and costs": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Karte und Kosten"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "GPU load": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "GPU-Last"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "GPU%@": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "GPU%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Gated models such as Llama or Gemma need a token, after you accept their licence on the model page.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Gesperrte Modelle wie Llama oder Gemma brauchen einen Token, nachdem du auf der Modellseite deren Lizenz zugestimmt hast."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "General": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Allgemein"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Give it an https address before it is reachable from the internet: in Coolify, set a domain for the service; elsewhere, put a reverse proxy such as Caddy in front of it. The server pays RunPod with its own API key, which you enter after pairing.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Gib ihm eine https-Adresse, bevor er aus dem Internet erreichbar ist: In Coolify trägst du eine Domain für den Dienst ein, sonst stellst du einen Reverse Proxy wie Caddy davor. Der Server bezahlt RunPod mit einem eigenen API-Schlüssel, den du nach dem Koppeln einträgst."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Good first choices for coding:": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Gut für den Anfang beim Programmieren:"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Half the memory, more room for context, and usually faster: measured twice as fast on the same card.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Halber Speicher, mehr Platz für Kontext und meist schneller: Auf derselben Karte doppelt so schnell gemessen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hide": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ausblenden"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hosting for new models": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hosting für neue Modelle"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How do I set up a server?": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wie richte ich einen Server ein?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hugging Face": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hugging Face"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hugging Face could not be reached.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hugging Face ist nicht erreichbar."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hugging Face could not be reached. Check the connection and try again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hugging Face ist nicht erreichbar. Prüfe die Internetverbindung und versuche es noch einmal."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hugging Face could not describe the model, so it cannot be taken over yet: %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hugging Face konnte das Modell nicht beschreiben, deshalb lässt es sich noch nicht übernehmen: %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hugging Face does not accept this token.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hugging Face akzeptiert diesen Token nicht."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hugging Face token": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hugging-Face-Token"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hugging Face token (recommended)": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hugging-Face-Token (empfohlen)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If the file has content, merge the \"providers\" entry. Then pick %@/<name> with /models.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Steht schon etwas in der Datei, übernimm nur den Eintrag „providers“. Wähle dann %@/<Name> mit /models."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If the file has content, merge the \"providers\" entry. Then pick the model with /model.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hat die Datei schon Inhalt, ergänze nur den Eintrag „providers“. Wähle dann mit /model das Modell."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If this Mac sleeps or Podlight quits, pods stop after a few minutes.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Schläft dieser Mac oder wird Podlight beendet, stoppen die Pods nach wenigen Minuten."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "In your coding agent (OpenCode, Cline, Aider, pi, …) choose a custom or OpenAI-compatible provider and enter these three values. A stopped model starts by itself when an agent asks for it; a new pod then needs up to 25 minutes, so start a new model in Podlight first.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wähle in deinem Coding-Agenten (OpenCode, Cline, Aider, pi, …) einen eigenen oder OpenAI-kompatiblen Anbieter und trage diese drei Werte ein. Ein gestopptes Modell startet von selbst, wenn ein Agent es anfragt. Ein neuer Pod braucht dann bis zu 25 Minuten, starte ein neues Modell deshalb zuerst in Podlight."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Install": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Installieren"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It stops earlier when no requests come in for %lld minutes, and by itself if the server %@ is unreachable for more than %lld minutes. It keeps running when this Mac sleeps or Podlight quits. You can extend it while it runs.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Er stoppt früher, wenn %1$lld Minuten lang keine Anfragen kommen, und von selbst, wenn der Server %2$@ länger als %3$lld Minuten nicht erreichbar ist. Schläft dieser Mac oder wird Podlight beendet, läuft er weiter. Du kannst ihn verlängern, während er läuft."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "It stops earlier when no requests come in for %1$lld minutes, and by itself if the server %2$@ is unreachable for more than %3$lld minutes. It keeps running when this Mac sleeps or Podlight quits. You can extend it while it runs."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It stops earlier when no requests come in for %lld minutes, and by itself if this Mac sleeps or Podlight quits for more than %lld minutes. You can extend it while it runs.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Er stoppt früher, wenn %1$lld Minuten lang keine Anfrage kommt, und von selbst, wenn dieser Mac schläft oder Podlight länger als %2$lld Minuten beendet ist. Solange er läuft, kannst du verlängern."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "It stops earlier when no requests come in for %1$lld minutes, and by itself if this Mac sleeps or Podlight quits for more than %2$lld minutes. You can extend it while it runs."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keep model on disk": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Modell zwischenspeichern"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Kept disks (%lld GB)": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Behaltene Festplatten (%lld GB)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Kept disks of stopped models": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Behaltene Festplatten gestoppter Modelle"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Last 30 days": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Letzte 30 Tage"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Later": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Später"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Leave a field empty for no limit.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Leer lassen bedeutet kein Limit."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Licence": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Lizenz"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Limit per day": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Limit pro Tag"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Limit per month": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Limit pro Monat"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Loading the model": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Modell wird geladen"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Longer contexts need more memory, so they may need a larger card or several. Speeds are estimates from memory bandwidth. If the chosen card is taken when you start, Podlight tries the next ones in this list.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mehr Kontext braucht mehr Speicher, also eine größere Karte oder mehrere. Das Tempo ist aus der Speicherbandbreite geschätzt. Ist die gewählte Karte beim Start vergeben, probiert Podlight die nächsten aus dieser Liste."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Longest context": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Längster Kontext"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Look for other Macs' models again": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Erneut nach Modellen anderer Macs suchen"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "MLX builds run on Apple chips only, not on RunPod's NVIDIA cards.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "MLX-Builds laufen nur auf Apple-Chips, nicht auf den NVIDIA-Karten von RunPod."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Manage this model on this Mac again": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dieses Modell wieder auf diesem Mac verwalten"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Managed by %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Verwaltet von %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Measured inside the pod %@. Updated about every 10 seconds.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Im Pod gemessen %@. Wird etwa alle 10 Sekunden aktualisiert."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Memory": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Speicher"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Memory per token": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Speicher pro Token"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Model": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Modell"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Models": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Modelle"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Models another Mac set up with the same RunPod key. Taking one over moves it to this Mac: from then on this Mac starts, stops and bills it, and the other Mac lets go. Only models whose pod exists (running, or stopped with its disk kept) are listed.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Modelle, die ein anderer Mac mit demselben RunPod-Key eingerichtet hat. Übernehmen holt eines auf diesen Mac: Ab dann startet, stoppt und berechnet es dieser Mac, und der andere gibt es ab. Aufgeführt sind nur Modelle, deren Pod existiert (läuft oder gestoppt mit behaltener Festplatte)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Models on the server keep running under its rules. To pair again later you need a new code from the server.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Modelle auf dem Server laufen nach seinen Regeln weiter. Um später wieder zu koppeln, brauchst du einen neuen Code vom Server."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Models on this Mac": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Modelle auf diesem Mac"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Models on your Podlight servers are not affected and keep running under the servers' rules.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Modelle auf deinen Podlight-Servern sind davon nicht betroffen und laufen nach den Regeln der Server weiter."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Move Podlight": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Podlight verschieben"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Move Podlight to Applications?": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Podlight in den Programme-Ordner verschieben?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Move to Applications": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "In Programme verschieben"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Name": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Name"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Name for agents": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Name für Agenten"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Needs a Hugging Face token": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Braucht einen Hugging-Face-Token"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Network": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Netzwerk"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "New Access Key": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Neuer Zugangsschlüssel"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "New Access Key…": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Neuer Zugangsschlüssel …"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "New Model…": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Neues Modell …"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "New access key": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Neuer Zugangsschlüssel"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Next steps": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nächste Schritte"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Next, add a model. Podlight checks whether it suits a coding agent, suggests a GPU and shows the cost per hour. Nothing is started or charged until you press Start.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Als Nächstes fügst du ein Modell hinzu. Podlight prüft, ob es sich für einen Coding-Agenten eignet, schlägt eine Karte vor und zeigt die Kosten pro Stunde. Gestartet und berechnet wird erst, wenn du auf „Starten“ klickst."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No GGUF files found in this repository.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "In diesem Repository gibt es keine GGUF-Dateien."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No Models Yet": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Noch keine Modelle"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No RunPod card can hold this model with its context. Choose a smaller context or a 4-bit variant.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Keine Karte bei RunPod fasst dieses Modell mit diesem Kontext. Wähle weniger Kontext oder eine 4-Bit-Variante."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No access keys yet.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Noch keine Zugangsschlüssel."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No answer: %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Keine Antwort: %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No card at RunPod can hold this model right now. Try a 4-bit build, or allow more regions above.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
